Dialogue: 0,1:04:41.18,1:04:42.12,CNsub,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,This is the twin parent of you.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.89,1:04:44.81,CNsub,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,405 and 410 rooms
